<title>USA: SEC suspends Novatek International trade.</title>
<headline>SEC suspends Novatek International trade.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Securities and Exchange Commission on Tuesday said it had suspended trading in Novatek International Inc because of questions about the accuracy of the company's information.</p>
<p>Trading will remain suspended until midnight October 28, the SEC said.</p>
<p>The comission cited concerns about reports dealing with the adequacy and accuracy of Novatek's financial condition, including the valuation of certain assests reported on its financial statement.</p>
</text>
